1
00:00:00,658 --> 00:00:03,078
(Penny:)You dog.

2
00:00:04,203 --> 00:00:05,493
(Penny:)Good for you.

3
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:08,580
- Does that change things?
- No.

4
00:00:09,542 --> 00:00:13,502
- So why'd you ask?
- I'm nosy. See you.

5
00:00:18,593 --> 00:00:21,343
MRS. WOLOWITZ [SHOUTING]:
Howard, get the door!

6
00:00:22,555 --> 00:00:25,265
HOWARD [SHOUTING]: Really? Is that
what you do when someone knocks?

7
00:00:25,433 --> 00:00:28,433
(Howard(voice):)Thank you, I had no idea!

8
00:00:30,313 --> 00:00:34,523
[IN NORMAL TONE] Hey, buddy.
What brings you to my little slice of hell?

9
00:00:34,692 --> 00:00:37,782
MRS. WOLOWITZ: Who is it?
- It's Leonard!

10
00:00:37,946 --> 00:00:40,326
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
You're gonna have to play outside!

11
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:44,030
(Howard's Mother(voice):)I'm not dressed to receive!

12
00:00:44,202 --> 00:00:46,372
(Howard:)No one cares, Ma!

13
00:00:46,537 --> 00:00:48,247
(Howard:)So, what's up?

14
00:00:48,873 --> 00:00:51,463
(Leonard:)Listen, I need to talk to you
about something.

15
00:00:51,626 --> 00:00:53,586
[CELL PHONE RINGS]

16
00:00:54,379 --> 00:00:55,419
(Howard(his phone rings):)Momentito.

17
00:00:56,381 --> 00:00:57,551
Hello?

18
00:00:57,715 --> 00:01:02,025
(Howard(his phone rings):)Oh, Stephanie, thanks for calling me back.
I was worried.

